## /Logic/Start Up (logic) — 13 nodes, 14 wires
  What happens when the game opens: the words of both languages, the two stores (the save, kept on this device, and the screen state), the grown-ups' changes laid over the game's tables, then the save opened and repaired. Sets the Variable "ready" when the game may draw.
  logic:
    su_words: Static Data "Words" {type: "json"}
        json:
          | [{"key":"school","fr":"École de danse Étoile","en":"Star Dance School"},{"key":"lang","fr":"EN","en":"FR"},{"key":"tabs_order","fr":"Programme","en":"Programme"},{"key":"tabs_formation","fr":"Formation","en":"Formation"},{"key":"tabs_gouter","fr":"Goûter","en":"Snacks"},{"key":"tabs_costumes","fr":"Costumes","en":"Costumes"},{"key":"tabs_build","fr":"La loge","en":"Dressing room"},{"ke
        comment: Every word on screen, French and English, from reference/src/i18n.js (tools/extract-words.mjs). {0} {1} are filled in by scripts/game/text.js; {0:s} is a plural s, {0:lower} lower-cases.
    su_wordsVar: Variable2 "words (shared on purpose)" {name: "words"}
        comment: Shared on purpose: every view Function reads the same words.
    su_fonts: CSS Definition "The game's fonts"
        style:
          | @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@500;700;800&family=Playball&display=swap');
          | html, body { overscroll-behavior: none; }
        comment: The three Google fonts the coded game used (index.html). Offline the system fonts in the tokens take over.
    su_gala: net.noodl.GlobalStore "gala: the save, kept on this device" {storeName: "gala", persist: true, storageKey: "gala-game-v2", initialState: {}}
        comment: Persisted in this browser's localStorage, as the coded game's save was. The grown-ups' changes are NOT here: they live in the backend so they survive a cleared browser.
    su_ui: net.noodl.GlobalStore "ui: what is on screen now" {storeName: "ui", persist: false, initialState: {"ui":{"screen":"prep","tab":"order","pickNum":"G1","selBlock":{},"selMove":null,"selChain":null,"allMoves":false,"editB":false,"pickDancer":null,"armed":null,"selected":null,"pickedRoom":null,"shopCat":"hall","speed":1,"follow":true,"introForced":false,"confirm":null,"renaming":false},"liv
    su_changes: DbCollection2 "The grown-ups' changes" {collectionName: "GameChange"}
        comment: Read once when the game opens. Unfiltered on purpose: every saved change applies.
    su_wait: Timer "Don't wait for the backend for ever" {duration: 4000}
        comment: If the backend cannot be reached the game still opens, with the tables as they ship.
    su_apply: JavaScriptFunction "Lay the grown-ups' changes over the game" {uses: "settings/apply,settings/check,rules/data"}
        inputs: rows
        outputs: ready: boolean, applied: number, refused: string
        run on value change OFF: rows
        functionScript:
          | const r = Scripts.apply.applyOnce(Inputs.rows || []);
          | Outputs.applied = r.count;
          | Outputs.refused = r.refused.join(', ');
          | Outputs.ready = true;
        comment: Every change is checked again in the browser (settings/check.js) before gala-rules' applyRows lays it over the tables, once per visit.
    su_open: JavaScriptFunction "Open the save" {uses: "game/save,rules/plan,rules/data"}
        inputs: rulesReady, storeReady, alreadyOpen, stored
        outputs: save: object, opened: signal
        run on value change OFF: stored, alreadyOpen
        functionScript:
          | if (!Inputs.rulesReady || !Inputs.storeReady || Inputs.alreadyOpen) return;
          | const stored = Inputs.stored || {};
          | Outputs.save = Scripts.save.mend(stored.save);
          | Outputs.opened();
        comment: After the changes are laid over the tables (a new school starts with the grown-ups' stars). Repairs an old save, or starts a fresh one. Once.
    su_storeReady: Switch "The save store has loaded"
    su_setSave: net.noodl.GlobalStore.Set "Write the opened save" {storeName: "gala", key: "save"}
    su_setReady: Set Variable "The game may draw" {name: "ready", setWith: "boolean", value: true}
    su_ready: Variable2 "ready" {name: "ready"}
  wires (from.port -> to.port):
    su_words.items -> su_wordsVar.value
    su_gala.ready -> su_wait.start
    su_gala.ready -> su_storeReady.on
    su_changes.items -> su_apply.in-rows
    su_changes.fetched -> su_apply.run
    su_changes.failure -> su_apply.run
    su_wait.timerFinished -> su_apply.run
    su_apply.out-ready -> su_open.in-rulesReady
    su_storeReady.state -> su_open.in-storeReady
    su_gala.state -> su_open.in-stored
    su_ready.value -> su_open.in-alreadyOpen
    su_open.out-save -> su_setSave.value
    su_open.out-opened -> su_setSave.set
    su_setSave.done -> su_setReady.do

